      "text": [
        "4583 - قَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"لَيْسَ مِنَّا مَنْ لَمْ يُؤْمِنْ بِكَرَّتِنَا وَ يَسْتَحِلَّ مُتْعَتَنَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4583 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"He is not from us who does not believe in our return (Rajah) and does not consider the temporary marriage (Mutah) lawful.\""
        ]
      }
